# ==============================================================================
# 工作区根级统一忽略规范 (Root .gitignore)
# 职责：全仓跨栈（Node/TS, Rust/Cargo, Godot 4, Python, Agent）第一道刚性防御中枢
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Node.js & TypeScript 构建与打包产物
node_modules/
dist/
out/
scripts/dist/
**/scripts/dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.vsix
*.tgz
.vscode-test/

# 2. Rust & Cargo 编译产物
target/
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# 3. Python 运行时、虚拟环境与测试缓存
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
*.venv
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# 4. Godot 4 游戏引擎与 WebGames 产物
.godot/
**/.godot/
*.translation
*.pck
user/
**/user/

# 5. auto-refactor 引擎与运行时缓存
**/.auto-refactor-cache/
**/.auto-refactor-cache-*/
**/.praxis/
**/.bench-corpus/
**/.*-corpus/
**/.corpus/
auto-refactor/bench/
**/.corpus-*.actual.json
**/*.actual.json
**/.*.actual.json
**/.t04-keypoints-*/
**/.t04-keypoints-*

# 6. 统一治理门禁、诊断报表与日志（精准匹配临时报告，避免误伤基线）
.audit-logs/
**/.audit-logs/
sarif/
**/sarif/
workspace-timing/reports/
WebGames/reports/
tests/reports/
**/reports/audit-*.json
**/reports/refactor-metrics*.json
*.log
err.txt
out.txt
status_summary.txt

# 7. AI 助手偏好记忆、插件下载与临时探针/草稿
.commandcode/
.atomcode/
.workbuddy/
.cursor/
.windsurf/
.agents/plugins/
WebGames/.agents/
.dsh-plugin-download/
dsh-uninstall-*.tsv
**/.trae-html-share-packages/
.probe-*
probe-*.*
*.probe.*
**/scratch/
scratch/
scratch_*.*
*.scratch.*

# 8. 本地运行时数据、临时文件与交换文件
tmp/
**/tmp/
temp/
**/temp/
*.tmp
*.temp
.workspace-timing-data/
.vscode/workspace-timing.json
.vscode/workspace-timing.journal

# 9. 历史版本与文档归档（物理冻结，针对性锚定，避免误伤代码包）
/archive/
/auto-refactor/archive/
/deliverables/

